    "identity": "E[floor(S*p/100)] = E[S]*p/100 - E[(S*p)%100]/100",
    "cache": "Contexts with the same lottery signature share one recording. Residue results are shared only within one scoreOrdersGekiso call; no cross-power or persistent unbounded residue cache.",
